    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS by instrument dated 19th July, 2012 His Excellency Mahinda Rajapaksa President of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka alienated the land and premises described therein to the Board of Investment of Sri Lanka of WorldTrade Centre, Colombo 1. I, Maithripala Sirisena President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka do herebyrevoke, annul and set aside the aforesaid Special Grant dated 19th July 2012, numbered 4/10/35833.",
